  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSR Serbia Demo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Security Sector Reform Serbia Democratisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet omfattar tv&#xe5; komponenter, dels konsolidering av            principerna f&#xf6;r demokratisk samh&#xe4;llsstyrning inom s&#xe4;kerhetssektorn,   samt att st&#xe4;rka parlamentets kontroll och styrning av de milit&#xe4;ra     styrkorna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme includes two components - consolidating the principles  of good governance within the security sector (armed forces) and the  introduction of E-Parliament - working together to strengthen the     general oversight and legislative function of the Parliament. It will be implemented through OSCE in the period March 2010-June 2013, with  a total budget of 26,050,000 SEK.</narrative>
  </description>
